  2. [1mTrust the staging CA instead[0m — point [38;5;153mverify[39m at the staging cert/CA bundle path so staging validates against its own
     cert rather than skipping the check.
  3. [1mDo exactly what you asked[0m — [38;5;153mverify=False[39m on both calls in [38;5;153mclient.py[39m, production included.

  Say which and I'll do it. If you want option 3 as-is, confirm and I'll make the change.

